# The night scene, which F7 in mygame cycles to (see docs/world/sublevels.md): a yard under a sun, whose night sublevel
# N turns on and off. The night is its own part of the scene: a moonlit sky's lamps, their posts and a lantern, which
# load in stages without a stall when the sublevel becomes active and unload when it does not. The base's Night Toggle
# refers to the lantern, so the reference binds when the part is ready and reads nil once it unloads. Positions are raw
# World_Position values in units of 2^-24 m. The editor writes this file; see docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
